      * @MBRTEXT: Join INVVEN and INVMST by Sku #: Vendor/Sku# order
     A                                      JDFTVAL
     A*
     A*  THIS JOIN LOGICAL FILE JOINS INVVEN (PRIMARY) AND SKVAUX
     A*    BY SKU NUMBER/LOCATION/PRIMARY VENDOR FLAG/VENDOR
     A*  - INVVEN IS IN VENDOR/SKU NUMBER ORDER
     A*
     A          R RINVVEN                   JFILE(SKVAUX INVVEN)
     A          J                           JOIN(SKVAUX INVVEN)
     A                                      JFLD(IXSKU  INUMBR)
     A                                      JFLD(IXSTOR IVSTOR)
     A                                      JFLD(IXVNUM IVVNUM)
     A* - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
     A*  INCLUDE THE FOLLOWING FIELDS FROM SKVAUX
     A            IXSKU                     JREF(1)
     A            IXSTOR                    JREF(1)
     A            IXVNUM                    JREF(1)
     A            IXPFLG
     A            IXSHPP
     A            IXSCRT
     A* - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
     A*  FIELDS THAT INVVEN IS KEYED ON
     A*           IVVNUM                    JREF(2)
     A* - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
     A*  INCLUDE ALL FIELDS FROM INVVEN
     A            IVSORT
     A            IVUMCV
     A            IVBYUM
     A            IVCCST
     A            IVVND#
     A            IVMQTY
     A            IVSLUM
     A            IVBYCV
     A            IVSDPK
     A            IVINPK
     A            IVDEPT
     A            IVSDPT
     A            IVCLAS
     A            IVSCLS
     A            IVFCST
     A            IVLEAD
     A* - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
     A* KEY
     A          K IXSKU
     A          K IXSTOR
     A          K IXPFLG
     A          K IXVNUM